--- the same call, from both sides of the pragma ---
outside, called outside: 3.5
inside,  called outside: 3
outside, called inside:  3.5
inside,  called inside:  3
--- the pragma reaches the whole rest of its block ---
half of 9 is 4
and a third is 3
--- a named sub declared inside the pragma's block ---
outer_half(7) = 3.5
inner_half(7) = 3
--- the pragma also truncates the operands of + - * ---
7.9 + 0.2   = 7
2.5 * 3.5   = 6
10.9 - 0.5  = 10
and outside:  7.9 + 0.2 = 8.1
--- no integer turns it back off ---
with:    4
without: 4.5
with:    4
